# Not cross-origin isolated (COOP "same-origin"): that severs the SwarmMemo
# sign-in popup from the feedback board, so nobody could sign in. The default
# Parakeet demo is single-threaded anyway; only the Moonshine fallback loses
# WASM threads. "credentialless" keeps cross-origin fonts and the CDN working
# without CORP headers.
# No referrer: nothing about visits leaks to third parties, and Hugging Face
# refuses model downloads whose Referer is a *.workers.dev address.
# no-transform: Cloudflare must not inject anything (e.g. its analytics
# beacon) into these pages; the site promises no telemetry.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate, no-transform
